/// the first non-positive pair, which keeps the estimate from being dragged
/// down by the noise of the tail. Lags are computed only until that truncation,
/// so a well-mixing chain costs two passes over the data. Returns the number of
/// independent draws with the same information content as the chain. # Errors
/// Returns an error for fewer than four draws or a constant chain.
inline Term effective_sample_size(const Term &a0) {
  Term args[] = {a0};
  return apply("effective_sample_size", args, 1);
}

