/// erf(a (1-i) z)`, `E₂ = erf(a (1+i) z)`: `C(z) = (1+i)/4 · E₁ + (1-i)/4 ·
/// E₂`, `S(z) = (1-i)/4 · E₁ + (1+i)/4 · E₂`. Real arguments take the real
