/// `idwt(approx, detail, wavelet)`: single-level inverse discrete wavelet
/// transform. Inverse of [`dwt`] (exact up to rounding). # Errors
/// [`WaveletError::Shape`] when the two coefficient lists differ in length or
/// are empty.
