/// N(0, R)`, started from `x_0 ~ N(x0, p0)`. # Errors Returns a diagnostic for
/// invalid shapes, non-finite data, nonsymmetric or indefinite model
/// covariances and an innovation covariance that is not positive definite.
/// Model covariances may be positive semidefinite.
