/// process-noise covariance and `V` the measurement-noise covariance. Returns
/// `L = P C^T V^{-1}` where `P` solves `A P + P A^T - P C^T V^{-1} C P + W =
/// 0`. # Errors Returns an error for inconsistent dimensions or a singular `V`.
