/// logistic map. For each value of r, the map is iterated and the final values
/// after discarding transients are recorded. # Arguments * `r_range` - The
/// range of r values `(r_min, r_max)`. * `num_r_values` - Number of r values to
/// sample. * `transient` - Number of initial iterations to discard. *
/// `num_points` - Number of points to record after transient. * `x0` - Initial
/// x value. # Returns A `Vec` of `(r, x)` pairs for plotting the bifurcation
/// diagram.
