/// Normalized coordinate conversion: radial/Cartesian coordinates are expressed
/// in one chosen positive reference length, angles in radians. Result
/// coordinates and Jacobians use the same normalization; mixed physical units
/// are not erased silently. Determinant of the Jacobian of the map `from -> to`
