/// polar-to-Cartesian and `r^2 sin(theta)` for spherical-to-Cartesian, while
/// the inverse maps carry the reciprocal determinant. It is built from the
/// central-difference Jacobian of [`numerical_jacobian`] and inherits its
/// accuracy and precision caveat (no analytic Jacobian). # Errors As
