/// Actual native fixed-delay RK4 method of steps. History tape(time)->state
/// sets the initial condition; RHS tape receives(time,state,delayed state).
/// tau/h are physical times, tau>=h, and the final native step clips the
/// endpoint. Returned samples carry true physical coordinates, not an invented
/// dense interpolant. Constant-delay DDE integrator (method of steps with RK4).
/// Constant-delay DDE `y'(t) = f(t, y(t), y(t - tau))` with history `hist(t)`
