/// explicit query/RHS evaluation budgets are preserved. Solves a general
/// (possibly state-dependent or time-dependent) Delay Differential Equation
/// (DDE) system `y'(t) = rhs(t, y(t), &|t_past| ...)` over `span = (t0, t1)`.
