/// t_past <= t`. # Errors [`OdeGeomError::Empty`] if `y0` is empty,
/// [`OdeGeomError::Domain`] for invalid span or tolerances,
/// [`OdeGeomError::ShapeMismatch`] for mismatched state dimensions, and
/// [`OdeGeomError::NotConverged`] if step size collapses.
