/// empty state, `t0 == t1` or a Jacobian of the wrong shape;
/// [`OdeError::NonFinite`] when the state or the estimate stops being finite;
/// [`OdeError::SolveFailed`] when Newton iteration does not converge at the
/// smallest step; [`OdeError::StepLimit`] when [`SdirkOptions::max_steps`] or
/// the step-size floor is reached.
