/// \\prod_{n=0}^{N-1} (1 + c / z_n^2)^{2^{-(n+1)}}` in the basin of infinity of
/// `f_c(z) = z^2 + c`, satisfying `\\phi_c(z^2 + c) = \\phi_c(z)^2`. # Errors
/// Returns an error if the orbit hits zero or does not clearly escape to
/// infinity.
