/// representable spacing. Constant samples use unit-width buckets starting at
/// the value minus 0.5, with all observations in the first bucket. Large
/// samples with a bounded number of buckets can be counted in parallel. The
/// counts and edges are independent of the active Rayon pool size. # Errors
