/// Actual generic native adaptive controller over caller-provided compiled
/// step/stability/event functions. Each scalar step output takes coherent
/// [time,step,state...] and has field units; stability takes [time,state...]
/// and returns Time, optional event returns dimensionless. Controls/state
/// arrays are normalized in the explicit frame; order is the supplied stepper's
/// actual order. Native step doubling, rejection/work budgets and
/// terminal-event localization are preserved. Adapt any restartable PDE step
/// kernel with a step-doubling error estimate. `order` is the selected method's
/// temporal order. `absolute_tolerances` has one positive entry per state
/// coefficient. `stability` returns the maximum stable step for the current
