/// Advances the retained 3D finite-volume mesh using measured velocity and
/// timestep. The Boolean mask is flat in x-fastest order or shaped [depth,
/// height, width]. True cells are set to zero on each step. Unmarked exterior
/// cells use zero inflow and free outflow. Returns a flat measured field in
/// x-fastest order. CFL and work bounds are checked. Advances the 3D linear
/// advection equation with first-order upwind fluxes. The callback marks cells
/// to set to zero on each time step. All other cells use a zero exterior state
/// at an inflow face and their own state at an outflow face. The returned
