/// Dirichlet boundary conditions. # Arguments * `global_k` - The global
/// stiffness matrix. * `forces` - The global force vector. * `fixed_dofs` - A
/// vector of tuples `(node_idx, prescribed_displacement)` for fixed degrees of
/// freedom. # Returns A `Result` containing a `Vec<f64>` of nodal
/// displacements, or an error string if the system is singular. # Errors
/// Returns an error if the force vector dimension mismatches the stiffness
/// matrix, or if the resulting system is singular.
