/// Koebe lower and upper bounds on |f'(z)| for normalized univalent functions
/// at |z|=r in [0,1). Koebe distortion theorem bounds for $f \\in \\mathcal{S}$
/// at $|z| = r \\in [0, 1)$: $\\frac{1-r}{(1+r)^3} \\le |f'(z)| \\le
/// \\frac{1+r}{(1-r)^3}$.
