/// Koebe lower and upper bounds on |f(z)| for normalized univalent functions at
/// |z|=r in [0,1). Koebe growth theorem bounds for $f \\in \\mathcal{S}$ at
/// $|z| = r \\in [0, 1)$: $\\frac{r}{(1+r)^2} \\le |f(z)| \\le
