/// g(x)`. `damping` in `(0, 1]` scales the step (`1` is the undamped method). A
/// step whose least-squares problem is degenerate, or that produces non-finite
/// numbers, falls back to the plain iterate and restarts the window. # Errors
/// [`LowRankError::Shape`] when `g` changes the length of the vector or the
/// start is not finite; [`LowRankError::NoConvergence`] when the residual is
