/// Native sparse factor/preconditioner with its matrix entry reference.
/// Application returns a normalized result with physical reference RHS/matrix;
/// shapes, unit domains and factor work are checked. IC(0) factorisation `A ≈ L
/// D L^T` (incomplete Cholesky without fill). The lower triangular factor uses
