/// Application returns a normalized result with physical reference RHS/matrix;
/// shapes, unit domains and factor work are checked. ILU(0) factorisation
/// (incomplete LU keeping the sparsity pattern). The factors are stored in the
/// pattern of `A`: the strictly lower entries of `L` (unit diagonal) and the
/// entries of `U` in the same arrays. No fill is created and no pivoting is
/// performed. # Returns `None` when the matrix has no entry on the diagonal of
/// some row or when a zero pivot is met (structurally or after elimination).
