/// Native sparse solver with explicit matrix/RHS reference domains. Solutions
/// retain RHS/matrix units; initial vectors use that normalized solution
/// reference. Native method/preconditioner choices, residuals and convergence
/// reports are preserved; shape and work budgets are checked. Flexible
/// GMRES(`restart`) with a variable right preconditioner. Flexible
/// GMRES(`restart`): right-preconditioned GMRES whose preconditioner `precond`
