/// Actual native low-rank/operator method. Matrices and state arrays retain
/// explicit physical references; orthonormal factors are dimensionless. Shapes,
/// iterations, callbacks and allocations are bounded. The `k` smallest
/// eigenpairs of a symmetric operator of size `n` by LOBPCG. `apply(x, y)`
