/// - The first tensor (`ndarray::ArrayD<f64>`). * `b` - The second tensor
/// (`ndarray::ArrayD<f64>`). # Returns The resulting outer product tensor as an
/// `ndarray::ArrayD<f64>`. # Errors Returns an error if input tensors are not
/// contiguous.
