/// rejected. The returned chain holds `n` draws taken every `thin` iterations
/// after `burn_in` discarded ones. # Errors Returns an error when the initial
/// state or `proposal_sd` is empty or mismatched, a proposal scale is not
/// positive and finite, `n` or `thin` is zero, the iteration budget overflows,
/// or the target log density is not finite at the initial state.
