/// Explicit native array/device object specialization. IR, buffer and generic
/// storage values are normalized; physical programs retain their tape reference
/// frame. Shapes and native execution work are bounded before launch.
/// Integrates `y' = f([t,] y; params)` from `t0` to `t1 > t0` for many initial
/// conditions at once with adaptive Dormand-Prince 5(4) steps. Every trajectory
/// carries its own time and step size on the device ([`dopri5_step`]), so a
/// stiff row takes small steps while the others take large ones. The host only
/// asks, every few launches, for the minimum of the time column
