/// not depend on the rest of the batch. # Errors Any [`DeviceError`];
/// [`DeviceError::Mismatch`] for `t1 < t0`, a wrong parameter count or ragged
/// initial conditions; [`DeviceError::Backend`] when some trajectory has not
/// arrived after `tolerance.max_launches` launches (a blow-up, or a tolerance
/// the float type cannot meet).
