/// algorithm is a popular numerical integration scheme for molecular dynamics
/// simulations. It is time-reversible and preserves phase space volume, making
/// it suitable for long-term simulations. # Arguments * `particles` - A mutable
/// vector of `Particle`s. * `dt` - The time step. * `num_steps` - The number of
