/// Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape
/// and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Real-time evolution with a complex
/// absorbing potential `-i W(x)` (`W >= 0`): after every potential half step
/// the amplitude is multiplied by `exp(-W dt / 2)`.
///
/// Higher-order: the function parameters are host callbacks.
