/// Brent-Kung composition then disagree in the last digits, not because either
/// is wrong but because they round at different points. Carrying the same two
/// algorithms over [`Dd`] drops the accumulated error to about `1e-32`
/// relative, so both round to the same `f64` and the answer is the
/// correctly-rounded one rather than whichever strategy happened to run.
