/// Multiply two descending-coefficient polynomials with the same coordinate
/// reference using the native FFT kernel. Coefficient units multiply.
/// Multiplies two polynomials using a packed 2-for-1 real-input complex FFT
/// backed by [`crate::kernels::reuse::fft_plan`] and
/// [`crate::kernels::reuse::fft_scratch_for`]. Falls back to
/// [`Self::mul_karatsuba`] if any input coefficient is non-finite. # Accuracy
/// The FFT accumulates a relative error of a few `f64` epsilons times `log n`,
