/// Actual native DG method with explicit geometry/time and per-component
/// physical references; normalized states, separate flux units and coherent
/// compiled callbacks preserve mixed Euler dimensions. Native algorithm and
/// limiter identity are retained; shapes, work and parent lifetimes are
/// checked. Integrates `q_t + ∇·F(q) = 0` on a hexahedral mesh to `t_end` with
/// SSP-RK3. `bcs` lists `[XMin, XMax, YMin, YMax, ZMin, ZMax]`. # Errors For an
